# What goes up to the builder.
#
# This file REPLACES .gitignore for the upload — it is not added to it. Every
# rule that matters has to be repeated here, because anything .gitignore hides
# from git but this file does not name is uploaded anyway. That is how a stale
# android/ ended up on the builder: EAS skips prebuild whenever the native
# directory is present, so app.json changes — icons, permissions — silently
# never reached the APK. Keep this in step with .gitignore.

# Regenerated on the builder by prebuild. Must be excluded, or CNG is off and
# app.json stops being the source of truth for anything native.
/android
/ios

node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts
.git-preMonorepo/

# Compiled output of the local native modules.
modules/*/android/build/
modules/*/android/.gradle/
modules/*/android/.cxx/
**/build/
**/.cxx/
.kotlin/
.metro-health-check*
*.tsbuildinfo

# Signing material and secrets. EAS holds the real credentials; nothing here
# should ever travel with the source.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
*.mobileprovision
.env*.local

*.apk
*.aab
*.orig.*
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.DS_Store
